[{"client_msg_id":"f6057ef2-7d2c-4800-bf27-933dc8c13485","type":"message","user":"UFHQ7TNT0","text":"一応、Emacsにもこういうのが同梱されてますね。\n\u003chttps://ayatakesi.github.io/lispref/27.1/html/SMIE.html#SMIE\u003e","ts":"1616243580.027600","attachments":[{"fallback":"SMIE (GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual)","id":1,"title":"SMIE (GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual)","title_link":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/lispref/27.1/html/SMIE.html#SMIE","text":"SMIE (GNU Emacs Lisp Reference Manual)","blocks":null,"service_name":"ayatakesi.github.io","from_url":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/lispref/27.1/html/SMIE.html#SMIE","original_url":"https://ayatakesi.github.io/lispref/27.1/html/SMIE.html#SMIE"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UgPUG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e20c56f8-4bff-46ee-897c-d76c0ff34682","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"`a.b.c` みたいなパターンだけを受け付ける BNF は、上のリンクにはってある BNF のうち\n```expression        = sub-expression\nsub-expression    = expression \".\" ( identifier )\nidentifier        = unquoted-string\nunquoted-string   = (%x41-5A / %x61-7A / %x5F) *(  ; A-Za-z_\n                        %x30-39  /  ; 0-9\n                        %x41-5A /  ; A-Z\n                        %x5F    /  ; _\n                        %x61-7A)   ; a-z```\nみたいな文法さえ実装すれば実現できそうですね。そのあたりから始めるのが良さそう？","ts":"1616242379.026900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NYj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5b464480-f71b-4ccb-b89b-0d1e452a7ab8","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"字句解析からやる場合は、とりあえずこの BNF の終端記号に相当するモノを token として見れば良い感じなんですかね。\nPEG パーサジェネレータしか使ったことがないのでよく分からない…","ts":"1616242054.024200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YAWbr"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0f7fb557-e00a-4323-82e6-af783d4471bc","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"別にフルの文法をサポートする必要はなくて小さいところから育てようとしたんですが、「これってどうやってやるのがいいんだ？？」ってなって手が止まってしまい。。","ts":"1616242045.024000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"+tsz"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8fed58fb-39b1-4ce7-a368-8ce84a88c56a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"意外と分量あるな","ts":"1616241954.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0286"}]},{"client_msg_id":"accce0a0-5aeb-4e77-a175-c53f49ea8def","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"あ、 BNF ありますね。\n\u003chttps://jmespath.org/specification.html#grammar\u003e","ts":"1616241896.022300","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DPpv"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f6d535e1-41bb-436b-aa02-44843727fa30","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"なるほど。function とかもあるんですね。思ったよりややこしそう","ts":"1616241760.022100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k2cK8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35f746f7-e18c-4b89-a28a-664da6fe03c5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"解析するのはJSONではなくてjmespathのDSLですね。\n```reservations[*].instances[*].state```\n\u003chttps://jmespath.org/tutorial.html\u003e\n\nJSONはパーサーが既に用意されてるので一発でlistにできます。私はjmespathのDSLに沿って検索するコードを書こうとしてますが、その前段のDSLの字句解析で詰まってしまったという次第で。。","ts":"1616241679.021800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"aZ+mn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"48fd90f4-8bfd-44d2-8c39-d947c5fa785b","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"JSONは公式サイトにBNF書いてあるのでその通りに実装すると解析できる","ts":"1616241661.021500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"e4ZOP"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UQWG2NARW","text":"\u003c@UQWG2NARW\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1616241561.020800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"592152bf-9140-4050-9a6f-834330f7f552","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"私も全然詳しくないですが、JSON の字句解析だったら記号も `{}[]:\",.\\` 程度しか出てこない気がするので、暖かみオートマトンでもなんとかなりそうですね。","ts":"1616241550.020600","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1616241589.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Hm7"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2ae0d10-0f6e-4612-9a04-ac76cc8a46d9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"字句解析ジェネレータはおおげさすぎる (し多分Elispにはない) ので暖かみのある手書きオートマトンを書こうとしてます。","ts":"1616241438.018800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"97/tn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"eb410db5-118f-444f-a7a9-32e4f37a0721","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"雑にやるときはトークンの正規表現書いてmatchallすることもあるな(Emacsでできるかは調べてない)","ts":"1616241295.018400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2mNpD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40af0506-1140-4cad-8c9d-e766a5c6ab48","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"暖かみのある手書きオートマトンだとか、字句解析ジェネレーターに食わせるだとか、そのへん？","ts":"1616241261.017300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fOkJN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c07d763a-27bf-4447-9a0b-11e3f4da9459","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"とりあえずトークンに分けるのと、その意味を解析するのは分けた方が良いというのを学びました。","ts":"1616240496.016200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Nxy1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6118c1f3-2ed6-41e0-b3d3-27813f6d44bb","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"ですね。Elisp全く関係なくて、一般的な字句解析をどうやって書けばいいのか分からないってところで止まってます。","ts":"1616240455.016000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=pik"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81129810-c1aa-48d5-9f1d-22cd799b22dd","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"Emacs lisp の知識が無くて全くわからないですが、文字列を順に食って unicode コードポイントを出力してる感じですかね？","ts":"1616239860.015700","edited":{"user":"UL6CFN8NR","ts":"1616239882.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DGc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96ab9121-fabe-480d-b707-f833612a2a2e","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"字句解析のノウハウがなくて全く分からない。","ts":"1616238951.015000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Eup"}]},{"client_msg_id":"15ccdac0-702b-48cf-af62-f39ab59adb05","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"おー。楽しい。\n```(iter-defun jmespath--str (str)\n  (let ((inx 0))\n    (dotimes (_ (length str))\n      (iter-yield (aref str inx))\n      (cl-incf inx))))\n;;=\u0026gt; jmespath--str\n\n(setq f (jmespath--str \"abc\"))\n;;=\u0026gt; ...\n\n(iter-next f)\n;;=\u0026gt; 97\n\n(iter-next f)\n;;=\u0026gt; 98\n\n(iter-next f)\n;;=\u0026gt; 99\n\n(iter-next f)\n;;=\u0026gt; Debugger entered--Lisp error: (iter-end-of-sequence)```\n","ts":"1616236259.014800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"66X"}]},{"client_msg_id":"06b2ccf1-8ae9-40ca-92a3-db8a33a0a2ca","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/jmespath/jmespath.py\u003e\n今日の自由時間はこれのElispポートを作ります。(宣言駆動型開発)","ts":"1616234282.014100","attachments":[{"fallback":"GitHub: jmespath/jmespath.py","id":1,"title":"jmespath/jmespath.py","title_link":"https://github.com/jmespath/jmespath.py","text":"JMESPath is a query language for JSON. Contribute to jmespath/jmespath.py development by creating an account on GitHub.","thumb_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6053930?s=400\u0026v=4","blocks":null,"service_name":"GitHub","service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/github.png","thumb_width":420,"thumb_height":420,"from_url":"https://github.com/jmespath/jmespath.py","original_url":"https://github.com/jmespath/jmespath.py"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"rms","count":5,"users":["U012MBD7MFZ","U9S4G0LJW","U78A6ESHM","U017BU3UZBQ","UFHQ7TNT0"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DAMES"}]}]
